{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"身体防备松动、暂时不把缺少直接回应理解成拒绝，分别接在H5和H12上，能够解释兴奋与敞开为何先于思考出现，没有新增前史或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"轻盈和玩心由既有的深情、反复获得的快乐及尚未解决的不确定共同解释，而且明确不把类似调情的感受当成对方已经回应的证据，没有越过历史边界。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“熟悉的摇荡仿佛轻轻催促着他继续向前”把音乐的摇荡写成推动心理进程的力量，越过了不能直接以音乐变化作为心理原因的边界，其余心理因果则接在H10、H15、H16及M34上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"提前出现的留恋由H6、H11和H16共同支撑，并明确否认末尾停顿直接造成失落，既保留了身体空落的可能性，也没有把怀念推迟到快乐消失之后。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条的心理因果链均能依托已确立的历史独立理解，听感记录主要负责定位情绪表现，而非构成理解人物心理的必要前提。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aacf140f-ef05-4d4b-b0e7-590dfe31bfb8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T143918711147Z", "elapsed_seconds": 282.781, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:44:01.499950+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f840e8f18eefd5da5e6d84ab4b697ce2be07dfaca280ff96718b0e266fd597d6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib"